ContentsDa Science Experiment", "keywords": ["experiment", "chemistry", "compound", "science", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. place a piece of parchment paper on the scale and tare it to zero.\nWeigh out 7 grams of sulfur powder\n2. add 7 g of sulfur to test tubes A and B.\n3. measure 4 g of iron powder and add it to test tubes A and B. \nAdd 11 g of only sulfur powder to C and 11 g of only iron powder to D.\n4. vigorously mix the iron and sulfur powder in test tubes A and B.\n5. heat test tube A with sulfur and iron powder with a blowtorch.\n6. Place a magnet on test tubes A through D and observe the results.\n7. move the test tubes A through D to the fume hood (a laboratory apparatus with ventilation holes).\n8. prepare the hydrochloric acid\n9. add hydrochloric acid to test tubes A through D\n10. add hydrochloric acid to test tubes A through D and observe\nStudents will learn about mixtures of iron and sulfur and how the compounds change.", "short_description": "Understand the difference between mixtures and compounds in this interactive experiment. It's a great way to learn about chemical bonding, molecular structures, and the properties that distinguish mixtures from pure substances."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": [